                                "text": "He was speedily reassured, and with a large, white, rascally grin, and a glance at his charge, seemed to take me into partnership in his exalted trust."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55ca6c26-0465-4967-8d30-a0b9d6206477",
                                "sense_id": "3268ed43-554f-3900-bebf-35143a4a0bbe",
                                "text": "If they keep marching as speedily as they are now, they should reach us within three days.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
